225
00:11:18,366 --> 00:11:22,276
Grassrivers, los pantanos.

226
00:11:22,276 --> 00:11:27,653
Port Gellhorn, la costa en decadencia.

227
00:11:27,653 --> 00:11:32,419
Ambrosia, el interior industrial.

228
00:11:32,419 --> 00:11:34,985
Y Mount Kalaga,

229
00:11:34,985 --> 00:11:38,652
